This covers the programs you run on your own machine:

- build_dataset.py
- the scripts under Data/
- the scripts under useful_data/
- the experiment programs under experiments/scripts/
- the tests under experiments/tests/

The Python package fieldshift_ml (experiments/src/fieldshift_ml) is a
library those programs import. That library is under the GNU Lesser
General Public License version 3, so another program can import it and
keep its own license. Its terms are in
experiments/src/fieldshift_ml/COPYING.LESSER, together with the GNU GPL
in experiments/src/fieldshift_ml/COPYING.

Files this project did not write stay under the terms of their
providers. That includes cached satellite and climate files, LUCAS and
WoSIS material, and the CSV tables built from those sources.
